{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"局部连通意象"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"局部连通意象"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>局部连通意象是"},{"Local":{"url":"拓扑学","text":"拓扑学"}},{"Plain":"中"},{"Local":{"url":"局部连通空间","text":"局部连通空间"}},{"Plain":"的类比.</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>固定一个基意象 $\\mathcal S$.</p>\n<p>对于意象 $f\\colon \\mathcal E \\to \\mathcal S$, 若如下等价条件成立, 则称之为<strong>局部连通意象</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$f^*$ 有左伴随 $f_!\\colon \\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal S$;</li>\n<li>$f^*$ 保持"},{"Local":{"url":"依值积","text":"依值积"}},{"Plain":": 对 $\\mathcal S$ 中任意态射 $h\\colon A\\to B$, 有 ${f_{/B}}^*\\Pi_h = \\Pi_{f^*h} {f_{/A}}^*$ (这是一个 "},{"Local":{"url":"基变换","text":"Beck–Chevalley 条件"}},{"Plain":").</li>\n</ul>\n<p>此时 $f_!$ 的直观是取 “连通分支的集合” $\\pi_0$, 或者在 $\\infty$-意象语境中是取 “基本 $\\infty$-群胚” (同伦型).</p>\n"}]}}